          "starterCode": "import numpy as np\n\ndef single_irls_step_norm(X: np.ndarray, y: np.ndarray, w0: np.ndarray, lam: float) -> float:\n    # TODO: hitung p = sigmoid(X @ w0), W = p*(1-p), g = X^T(p-y) + lam*w0,\n    # H = (X^T * W) @ X + lam*I, lalu w_next = w0 - solve(H, g) dan kembalikan round(||w_next||_2, 6)\n    pass\n\nX_t = np.array([[1.0, 2.0], [1.0, -1.5], [1.0, 0.5], [1.0, -0.8], [1.0, 1.4]])\ny_t = np.array([1.0, 0.0, 1.0, 0.0, 1.0])\nprint(f'irls_step_norm={single_irls_step_norm(X_t, y_t, np.zeros(2), lam=0.5):.6f}')",
