          "starterCode": "import numpy as np\n\ndef recalibrate_prior_mean(p_bal: np.ndarray, pi_true: float, pi_bal: float = 0.5) -> float:\n    # TODO: hitung logit_b = log(p/(1-p)), kurangi log((pi_bal/(1-pi_bal)) / (pi_true/(1-pi_true))),\n    # konversi via sigmoid, lalu kembalikan round(mean(p_true), 6)\n    pass\n\nprint(f'recal_mean={recalibrate_prior_mean([0.20, 0.50, 0.80, 0.95], pi_true=0.04, pi_bal=0.50):.6f}')",
