          "solution": "```python\nimport numpy as np\n\ndef recalibrate_prior_mean(p_bal: np.ndarray, pi_true: float, pi_bal: float = 0.5) -> float:\n    p = np.clip(np.asarray(p_bal, dtype=float), 1e-12, 1.0 - 1e-12)\n    logit_b = np.log(p / (1.0 - p))\n    shift = np.log((pi_bal / (1.0 - pi_bal)) / (pi_true / (1.0 - pi_true)))\n    p_true = 1.0 / (1.0 + np.exp(-(logit_b - shift)))\n    return round(float(np.mean(p_true)), 6)\n```"
